; Curated movesets for MSRC_SET, generated by tools/gen_movesets.py from
; tools/corpus/moveset_catalog.tsv, the tracked list of every set ever considered
; (MOVESET_REVISION_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md). NOT wired into `make` - edit the
; catalog, re-run by hand and commit both. Never hand-edit this file.
;
; Catalog: 2444 rows, 1872 ACTIVE, 571 ARCHIVED, 1 HELD. Emitted: 1872 sets from the ACTIVE rows.
; Level-bumped: 258 records had lvl_min raised to the level the mon's
;   line first learns all four moves (lvl_max raised to match if passed).
;   Mew, Mewtwo, Celebi, Lugia and Ho-Oh are exempt (LEVEL_BUMP_EXEMPT).
; Plus 29 character sets (levels 1-100, tagged `; roster <Prefix>`)
;   from the Sets tables in data/trainers/PARTY_ROSTER.md.
; Plus 93 regional/eeveelution FORM records in their own
;   section, found through MovesetFormIndex. A form mon never reads its base
;   species' sets: a base set can carry moves the form cannot learn.

SECTION "Movesets Index", ROMX, BANK[$3D]

; One record per curated set: db move1, move2, move3, move4, tier, origin_id,
; lvl_min, lvl_max. Species is NOT stored per-record - it is implied by which
; species' run of records this is, addressed via MovesetSpeciesIndex.
DEF MOVESET_RECORD_SIZE EQU 8

SECTION "Movesets 1", ROMX, BANK[$3A]
; 7192 of 7192 budgeted bytes

